    "review": "The run died, but the final melee transition does not establish a definite killer. An earlier preparation loop is directly recorded: decisions 776–778 (log lines 2286–2291) leave an open doorway for a potion-test bank, reenter the closed doorway, and repeat. Both movement leaves report intent 'other', bypassing navigation-loop accounting. The clock advances; decision 904 spends a puzzle-backed meal, and staging continues through decision 993. Source browsing identifies incompatible doorway/stash staging and missing movement semantics, not known potion identities. A public-geometry fixture reproduces decision 776's selected input on original source. The focused correction labels existing staging and entrance movement REPOSITION so existing navigation safeguards apply, without changing hazard admission or collection duties. Original-source regression: two expected assertion failures; candidate: both pass; full suite: 1531 tests, OK, four skipped. This establishes accounting, not a safe puzzle solution or survival improvement.",
